#. translators: Button that opens WPML's Translation Management dashboard. Keep the bold tags around the screen name. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:248
msgid "Go to <b>Translation Management</b>"
msgstr "עבור אל <b>ניהול תרגום</b>"

#. translators: Heading of the Multilingual Setup panel, above the three translation options. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:280
msgid "Select a translation option for this field group"
msgstr "בחר אפשרות תרגום עבור קבוצת שדות זו"

#. translators: First paragraph describing the "Same content in every language, translated" option.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:285
msgid "Visitors everywhere see the same pages, in their own language. Text is translated; layout and settings stay identical."
msgstr "מבקרים בכל מקום רואים את אותם עמודים, בשפה שלהם. הטקסט מתורגם; הפריסה וההגדרות נשארות זהות."

#. translators: Second paragraph describing that same option. Keep the bold tags around the two WPML feature names.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:287
msgid "You translate in the WPML <b>Translation Editor</b>. This works with automatic translation and <b>Translate Everything</b>."
msgstr "אתה מתרגם ב-<b>עורך התרגום</b> של WPML. זה עובד עם תרגום אוטומטי ועם <b>תרגם הכל</b>."

#. translators: First paragraph describing the "Each language has its own content" option.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:292
